Tells Mantella how aroused NPCs are, so they act on it in their own way.

[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]TEMPERAMENT[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Temperament[/th][th]Aroused[/th][th]At her peak[/th][/tr][tr][td]Reserved[/td][td]Keeps it to herself[/td][td]Hints at most[/td][/tr][tr][td]Bold[/td][td]Lets it show, drops hints[/td][td]Asks you directly, accepts no[/td][/tr][tr][td]Forward[/td][td]Says it openly[/td][td]Begs (never starts a scene without you)[/td][/tr][/table][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]APPETITE[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]State[/th][th]What happens[/th][/tr][tr][td]Rated[/td][td]Mantella rates her appetite once, from her bio[/td][/tr][tr][td]Counting[/td][td]Climaxes this session are counted against it[/td][/tr][tr][td]Satisfied[/td][td]Arousal drops; she is content[/td][/tr][tr][td]Overwhelmed[/td][td]Far past it; she asks to rest[/td][/tr][/table][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]REQUIREMENTS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/65454]OSL Aroused[/url][/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]INSTALLATION[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*]Install the hub, then this module.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]NOTES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*]Climaxes are counted from OStim scenes and from what NPCs report in conversation.[/*][*]Temperament is set per NPC with the hub's hotkey, or left on Auto.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]SOURCE AND LICENSE[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][url=https://github.com/Abhisek571/Mantella-Living-World-Arousal]GitHub[/url], GNU AGPL-3.0 (Mantella is AGPL-3.0). Unofficial, not endorsed by the authors of the mods it works with.

